SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The license above covers the code in this repository: `scripts/` and the
repository's own documentation.

It does NOT cover the contents of `apps/` and `diffs/`. Those directories hold
snapshots of third-party App Store and Google Play listing data — descriptions,
pricing and metadata authored and owned by the respective app publishers. That
material is reproduced here as captured research data for a change-detection
study. It is not licensed by the copyright holder above, who claims no rights
over it and grants none.
